  "about": [
    "The project vocabulary for ASD-STE100 Issue 9 (Simplified Technical English). docs/STE_GLOSSARY.md explains it; test/ste_text.test.cjs uses it.",
    "approved: the approved words that our texts use, with the part of speech and the listed forms of the verbs and adjectives. Nouns also have the plural.",
    "technicalNouns and technicalVerbs: ours, with the category of Rule 1.5 or Rule 1.12 and the irregular forms. A term of more than one word is matched first.",
    "deny: words that we do not use, with the STE alternative that we use. british: the American spelling (Rule 1.14). units: case-sensitive unit symbols (Rule 8.6).",
    "This file holds headwords only. It holds no definitions, examples or other text from the standard, and it is not a copy of the STE dictionary."
